      "label": "Unsent letter",
      "model": "letter",
      "codex": "burgomaster_last_letter",
      "text": "To any soul with a sword and a conscience: I am the burgomaster of a village you have never heard of, and I am writing because no one else will. My daughter is hunted by the lord of this land. My house is attacked each night by his creatures. I am old and my heart is failing. If you come, come soon; there is little I can offer but my thanks and my house. Ask for my son at the tavern. [The rest is crossed out. A later line, shakier:] Ismark, if I don't finish this, finish it for me."
    }
